# This repo keeps NO secrets inside the working tree.
# The real values live in two files outside the repo, both chmod 600:
#
#   ~/secrets/clickhouse.env   ClickHouse credentials. Used by docker compose
#                              (env_file) and by the tests.
#   ~/secrets/api-keys.env     API keys. Optional: only needed by code that
#                              talks to Alchemy or Nansen (backfill, checks).
#
# They are split so that an unattended process can be given database access
# without being able to read the API keys (see DECISIONS.md).
#
# If your files live somewhere else, copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and
# set the two pointers below. .env holds PATHS ONLY, never secret values.
# Both docker compose and src/univ3_indexer/config.py read these pointers.

CLICKHOUSE_ENV_FILE=
API_KEYS_ENV_FILE=

# --- contents expected in clickhouse.env -----------------------------------
# CLICKHOUSE_DB=
# CLICKHOUSE_USER=
# CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD=
# CLICKHOUSE_DEFAULT_ACCESS_MANAGEMENT=
# CH_HOST=
# CH_PORT=

# --- contents expected in api-keys.env -------------------------------------
# ALCHEMY_API_KEY=
# NANSEN_API_KEY=
